Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.43,0:00:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Window bhi set kar sakte hain — start date aur end date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.03,0:00:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirf uss period ke transactions reconcile honge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Deletion bhi scoped hai matlab agar window mein koi voucher extra hai
